@allure.label.owner:faheemanis
@allure.label.epic:purchase
Feature: Purchase Order

Scenario: Create Purchase Order
    Given we visit "orders/purchaseOrder"
        and we click "Show/hide Form" button
        and we select "SUSEN FACTORY" in "customers_id" autocomplete
        and we enter "2025-05-08" in "orderDate"
        and we enter "200" in "cartage"
        and we fill the grid with:
            | Items                                       | Rate | Qty | Disc. % | Disc. Amt. | Fixed Disc. | Stax | Stax Amt | Amount |
            | JS011BLACK -  JS 011 Black - 1PCS - 14978   | 100  | 5   | 0       | 0          | 0           |      | 0        | 500    |
                When we click "Save" button
    Then we should see success message
    and we should see this entry in grid:
        | customers_id  | currency_value |
        | SUSEN FACTORY | 700            |

Scenario: Edit Purchase Order
    Given we visit "orders/purchaseOrder"
       when we edit the top row
       and we wait "3" seconds
       then we should see "SUSEN FACTORY" in "customers_id" autocomplete
       then we should see "2025-05-08" in "orderDate"
       then we should see "200" in "cartage"
       then we should see the following in grid:
             | Items                                       | Rate | Qty | Disc. % | Disc. Amt. | Fixed Disc. | Stax | Stax Amt | Amount |
             | JS011BLACK -  JS 011 Black - 1PCS - 14978   | 100  | 5   | 0       | 0          | 0           |      | 0        | 500    |
Scenario: Update Purchase Order
    Given we visit "orders/purchaseOrder"
        when we edit the top row
        and we wait "3" seconds
        and we select "SUSEN TRD" in "customers_id" autocomplete
        and we enter "2024-10-15" in "orderDate"
        and we enter "200" in "cartage"
         and we fill the grid with:
            | Items                                                                   | Rate | Qty | Disc. % | Disc. Amt. | Fixed Disc. | Stax | Stax Amt | Amount |
            | ECOTRAVELLUGGAGE24BLACK -  ECO TRAVEL LUGGAGE 24 Black - 1PCS - 16947   | 150  | 5   | 0       | 0          | 0           |      | 0        | 750    |
    When we click "Save" button
    Then we should see success message
    and we should see this entry in grid:
        | customers_id | currency_value |
        | SUSEN TRD    | 950            |

Scenario: Delete Purchase Order
    Given we visit "orders/purchaseOrder"
    when we store the top row's DOC Id
        and we delete the top row
    then we should not see the stored Doc Id
